      "patch": "@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@\n <p>Based in Lagos, Nigeria, Afrotype, founded by Seyi Olusanya, intends to subvert cliches around African graphic design and identity by creating typefaces that are grounded in African history and culture. </p>\n-<p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/useafrotype\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a> | <a href=\"https://www.afrotype.com\" target=\"_blank\">afrotype.com</a></p>\n\\ No newline at end of file\n+<p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/useafrotype\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a> | <a href=\"https://ogbeniseyi.com\" target=\"_blank\">ogbeniseyi.com</a></p>\n\\ No newline at end of file"
    },
    {
