      "patch": "@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@\n <p>The ANRT (Atelier national de recherche typographique) is a postgraduate research course in type design and typography based in Nancy, France</p>\n-<p><a href=\"https://anrt-nancy.fr/en/presentation-en/\" target=\"_blank\">anrt-nancy.fr</a> | <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/anrt_type/\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a></p>\n+<p><a href=\"https://anrt-nancy.fr/en/\" target=\"_blank\">anrt-nancy.fr</a> | <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/anrt_type/\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a></p>"
