      "patch": "@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@\n <p>Mateusz Machalski, PhD, studied at the Academy of Fine Arts in Warsaw (PhD in Typeface Design 2020, MA in Graphic Design 2014). He works at the Faculty of Graphics in the Studio of Multimedia Artistic Creation at his <i>alma mater</i>. He is a member of the board of the Association of Applied Graphic Designers in Poland.</p>\n-<p><a href=\"https://capitalics.wtf/pl/designer/mateusz-machalski\" target=\"_blank\">Homepage</a></p>\n\\ No newline at end of file\n+<p><a href=\"https://capitalics.wtf\" target=\"_blank\">Capitalics</a></p>"
