      "patch": "@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@\n <p>Przemysław Hoffer graduated the Academy of Fine Arts in Katowice. He is a designer and initiator of graphic design and arts exhibitions and events. He co-founded the Distort Visual Collective, which focuses on the use of classical typography based on metal typesetting and printing art. He collaborates with the Book Arts Museum in Lodz since 2011.</p>\n-<p><a href=\"https://capitalics.wtf/en/designer/przemyslaw-hoffer\" target=\"_blank\">Homepage</a></p>\n\\ No newline at end of file\n+<p><a href=\"https://capitalics.wtf\" target=\"_blank\">Capitalics</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "sha": "3479607f646fd6e1364d270a006336ed6d145d0d",
      "filename": "catalog/designers/superunion/bio.html",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 2,
      "deletions": 2,
      "changes": 4,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/google/fonts/blob/cc5661d43cd4f9aad5567033a8e15ca28dc35c86/catalog%2Fdesigners%2Fsuperunion%2Fbio.html",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/google/fonts/raw/cc5661d43cd4f9aad5567033a8e15ca28dc35c86/catalog%2Fdesigners%2Fsuperunion%2Fbio.html",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/google/fonts/contents/catalog%2Fdesigners%2Fsuperunion%2Fbio.html?ref=cc5661d43cd4f9aad5567033a8e15ca28dc35c86",
      "patch": "@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@\n-<p>Superunion is a revolutionary creative company, with expertise in strategy, design, communications, and brand management. Superunion works with clients that include some of the world’s most iconic brands, alongside technology unicorns, ambitious start-ups and inspiring not-for-profits. Superunion believes in the power of ideas to create positive, meaningful change.</p>\n-<p><a href=\"https://www.superunion.com\" target=\"_blank\">superunion.com</a></p>\n+<p>Superunion was a revolutionary creative company, with expertise in strategy, design, communications, and brand management. In 2023, Superunion merged with Design Bridge to form Design Bridge and Partners.</p>\n+<p><a href=\"https://www.designbridge.com/\" target=\"_blank\">designbridge.com</a></p>"
    },
    {
