      "patch": "@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@\n <p>Tina Anderson is a software engineer and type designer based in Australia. She has primarily worked as a freelance programmer involved with various business applications and became interested in educational app development for Little Australian Schoolies as her grandchildren came of school age.</p>\n-<p><a href=\"https://www.auschoolhandwritingfonts.com/\" target=\"_blank\">auschoolhandwritingfonts.com</a></p>\n+<p><a href=\"https://github.com/MezMerrit/AU-School-Handwriting-Fonts\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a></p>"
    },
    {
